# Home's numbered rows open each section, Esc comes back to Home, and Home keeps its selection.
start ^ Home
key 1 => ^ Live sports: choose a sport
key Esc => ^ Home
key 2 => ^ Replays: choose a sport
key Esc => ^ Home
key 3 => ^ Live TV
key Esc => ^ Home
key 4 => ^ Search
key Esc => ^ Home
key 5 => ^ Settings
key Esc => ^ Home
key Up => >\s+4\s+Search
key Enter => ^ Search
